    "Verify CVE applicability before spending time",
    "Full port scan: secondary vuln often on different port",
    "Redis unauth: write webshell to web dir if writable",
    "Check web.config.bak, backup shares for creds",
    "PHP-FPM bypass: different Apache version on 8080"
  ],

